# NOTE: *.import files must be committed in Godot 4.
# They carry the stable uid:// that .tscn/.tres files reference. If they are
# ignored, every clone regenerates fresh random UIDs, the uid:// references
# baked into scenes no longer resolve, and Godot logs an "invalid UID" warning
# for each one on every load. (The .import/ folder was a Godot 3 concept.)
